 "about": "Alfheim, realm of the light elves. Lumenvale is built in the crowns of giant silverbark trees: the Glimmer Steps curve round the greatest trunk in three terraces (the Wisp Market and Ferrin's glow-pool below, the Lantern Walk in the middle, the spiral stair up to the Moonlit Court on top), hung with violet vine curtains and glow orbs. The Gatelight arch leads back to Bifrost Crossing; the glass bridge west goes down to the Wispwood.",
